WHAT THIS IS

DFM, and all of its subsidiaries, builds defensive & adversarial tooling for
people and organizations who do not consent to having their work harvested:
honeypots, poisoned bait, provenance seals, canaries, scrapers' traps, metadata
scrubbers, and verification tooling.

It is Apache 2.0 licensed on purpose. The tools are meant to be deployed as
widely as possible, including inside companies, including by anyone whose
legal department will not clear a license with use restrictions in it. The
threat these tools exist to address does not respect licenses, so a license
restriction would only ever have burdened the people trying to defend
themselves. Use them. Ship them. Sell them.


